{"id":"ncrp-6-2-2","ref":"AN 7.64","title":"kodhanasutta","titleEn":"The Angry Person","source":"NCRP Lesson 6 · Further reading 2","credit":"English: course exercise book, after Bhikkhu Bodhi, The Numerical Discourses of the Buddha (Wisdom Publications, 2012).","bookLesson":6,"section":"further","paras":[{"t":[["kodhano","kodhano"],[" "],["dubbaṇṇo","dubbaṇṇo"],[" "],["hoti","hoti"],[",\n"],["atho","atho"],[" "],["dukkhampi","dukkhampi"],[" "],["seti","seti"],[" "],["so","so"],[",\n"],["atho","atho"],[" "],["atthaṃ","atthaṃ"],[" "],["gahetvāna","gahetvāna"],[",\n"],["anatthaṃ","anatthaṃ"],[" "],["adhipajjati","adhipajjati"],["."]],"en":"The angry one is ugly;\nhe also sleeps badly;\nhaving gained some benefit,\nit turns out to be harmful."},{"t":[["tato","tato"],[" "],["kāyena","kāyena"],[" "],["vācāya","vācāya"],[",\n"],["vadhaṃ","vadhaṃ"],[" "],["katvāna","katvāna"],[" "],["kodhano","kodhano"],[",\n"],["kodh’ābhibhūto","kodh’ābhibhūto"],[" "],["puriso","puriso"],[",\n"],["dhana-jāniṃ","dhana-jāniṃ"],[" "],["nigacchati","nigacchati"],["."]],"en":"The angry one,\nhaving slain by body and speech,\na person overcome by anger,\nundergoes the loss of wealth."},{"t":[["kodha-sammada-sammatto","kodha-sammada-sammatto"],[",\n"],["āyasakyaṃ","āyasakyaṃ"],[" "],["nigacchati","nigacchati"],[",\n"],["ñāti-mittā","ñāti-mittā"],[" "],["suhajjā","suhajjā"],[" "],["ca","ca"],[",\n"],["parivajjanti","parivajjanti"],[" "],["kodhanaṃ","kodhanaṃ"],["."]],"en":"Maddened by the madness of anger,\nhe acquires a bad reputation.\nHis relatives, friends, and loved ones\navoid the angry one."},{"t":[["anattha-janano","anattha-janano"],[" "],["kodho","kodho"],[",\n"],["kodho","kodho"],[" "],["citta-ppakopano","citta-ppakopano"],[",\n"],["bhayamantarato","bhayamantarato"],[" "],["jātaṃ","jātaṃ"],[",\n"],["taṃ","taṃ"],[" "],["jano","jano"],[" "],["n’āvabujjhati","n’āvabujjhati"],["."]],"en":"Anger is a producer of harm;\nanger [is] turmoil of mind.\nPeople do not recognize\nthe peril arisen fr